            "description": "<p>President Trump <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/trump-plans-tariff-push-100-071715850.html\">announced</a> sweeping new tariffs on pharmaceuticals, heavy trucks, and furniture imports. The duty on pharmaceuticals sits at 100% for patented drugs unless the producer is building a manufacturing plant in the US.</p>\n<p>White House columnist for The Hill, Niall Stanage, and Yahoo Finance senior reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> outline the details of the tariff policy and examine the respective market reactions.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
